{"seq":3,"slug":"text-preprocessing","title":"文本预处理管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/foundations/text-preprocessing","wordCount":1289,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"文本预处理管道\">文本预处理管道</h1><p>文本预处理（Text Preprocessing）是信息检索系统的第一道关卡，将原始文档和查询转化为可以进行词项匹配的规范化形式。预处理质量直接决定召回率和精确率的上限——词形错误的标准化、同义词的扩展、停用词的过滤都在这一阶段完成。本篇系统讲解从分词到 N-gram 的完整预处理管道及其工程实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Raw[原始文本] --&gt; Tok[分词\\nTokenization]&#10;    Tok --&gt; Lower[小写化\\nLowercasing]&#10;    Lower --&gt; Stop[停用词过滤\\nStopword Removal]&#10;    Stop --&gt; Stem[词干化/词形还原\\nStemming/Lemmatization]&#10;    Stem --&gt; Syn[同义词扩展\\nSynonym Expansion]&#10;    Syn --&gt; NGram[N-gram 生成\\nN-gram Generation]&#10;    NGram --&gt; Terms[标准词项]\">graph LR\n    Raw[原始文本] --&gt; Tok[分词\\nTokenization]\n    Tok --&gt; Lower[小写化\\nLowercasing]\n    Lower --&gt; Stop[停用词过滤\\nStopword Removal]\n    Stop --&gt; Stem[词干化/词形还原\\nStemming/Lemmatization]\n    Stem --&gt; Syn[同义词扩展\\nSynonym Expansion]\n    Syn --&gt; NGram[N-gram 生成\\nN-gram Generation]\n    NGram --&gt; Terms[标准词项]</pre><p>同一管道同时作用于<strong>文档索引期</strong>和<strong>查询解析期</strong>，保证两端词项空间一致。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>主要工具</th>\n<th>错误代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分词</td>\n<td>Jieba（中文）、ICU（多语言）、标准分词器</td>\n<td>错误分词影响所有下游</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>停用词</td>\n<td>领域停用词表</td>\n<td>过滤太多降低召回，过少增加噪声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>词干化</td>\n<td>Porter Stemmer、Snowball</td>\n<td>过度词干化导致词义混淆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同义词扩展</td>\n<td>自定义同义词词典</td>\n<td>错误同义词引入假相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>N-gram</td>\n<td>Unigram、Bigram、Trigram</td>\n<td>空间爆炸，需要谨慎选择</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分词-中文与多语言挑战\">分词：中文与多语言挑战</h2><p><strong>英文分词</strong>相对简单，按空格和标点切分，主要挑战是复合词、缩写和特殊字符：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入: &quot;machine-learning algorithms&quot;&#10;输出: [&quot;machine&quot;, &quot;learning&quot;, &quot;algorithms&quot;]  (连字符分割)&#10;   或 [&quot;machine-learning&quot;, &quot;algorithms&quot;]      (保留复合词)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入: \"machine-learning algorithms\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出: [\"machine\", \"learning\", \"algorithms\"]  (连字符分割)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   或 [\"machine-learning\", \"algorithms\"]      (保留复合词)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>中文分词</strong>没有天然空格分隔，是核心难点。主流方案：</p>\n<p><strong>Jieba 分词</strong>（Python 生态最常用）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于 HMM + 词典的混合方法</li>\n<li>三种模式：精确模式、全模式、搜索引擎模式</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import jieba&#10;&#10;text = &quot;自然语言处理是信息检索的基础技术&quot;&#10;&#10;# 精确模式（默认）&#10;list(jieba.cut(text))&#10;# [&#39;自然语言处理&#39;, &#39;是&#39;, &#39;信息检索&#39;, &#39;的&#39;, &#39;基础技术&#39;]&#10;&#10;# 搜索引擎模式（更细粒度）&#10;list(jieba.cut_for_search(text))&#10;# [&#39;自然&#39;, &#39;语言&#39;, &#39;自然语言&#39;, &#39;处理&#39;, &#39;自然语言处理&#39;, &#39;是&#39;, &#39;信息&#39;, &#39;检索&#39;, &#39;信息检索&#39;, &#39;的&#39;, &#39;基础&#39;, &#39;技术&#39;, &#39;基础技术&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> jieba</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">text </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"自然语言处理是信息检索的基础技术\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 精确模式（默认）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(jieba.cut(text))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ['自然语言处理', '是', '信息检索', '的', '基础技术']</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 搜索引擎模式（更细粒度）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">list</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(jieba.cut_for_search(text))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ['自然', '语言', '自然语言', '处理', '自然语言处理', '是', '信息', '检索', '信息检索', '的', '基础', '技术', '基础技术']</span></span></code></pre></div><p>搜索引擎模式将长词拆分为子词，提高召回率但可能引入噪声。</p>\n<p><strong>ICU 分词</strong>（Elasticsearch 内置，多语言场景）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于 Unicode ICU 库，支持几乎所有语言</li>\n<li>中文按单字切分（unigram），结合 n-gram 提高召回</li>\n<li>适合多语言混合内容</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// Elasticsearch ICU 分词器配置&#10;{&#10;  &quot;settings&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;analysis&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;analyzer&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;icu_analyzer&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;icu_analyzer&quot;,&#10;          &quot;tokenizer&quot;: &quot;icu_tokenizer&quot;,&#10;          &quot;filter&quot;: [&quot;icu_folding&quot;]&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Elasticsearch ICU 分词器配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"settings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"analysis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"icu_analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"icu_analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"tokenizer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"icu_tokenizer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"filter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"icu_folding\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"停用词过滤与词干化\">停用词过滤与词干化</h2><p><strong>停用词（Stopwords）</strong> 是出现频率极高但对相关性判断贡献很小的词，如英文的 &quot;the&quot;, &quot;is&quot;, &quot;a&quot; 和中文的 &quot;的&quot;、&quot;了&quot;、&quot;在&quot;。</p>\n<p>停用词过滤的权衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过滤力度</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过于激进（过滤 100+ 词）</td>\n<td>减小索引体积，加速查询</td>\n<td>破坏短语查询（&quot;to be or not to be&quot;）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适度（过滤 20-50 词）</td>\n<td>平衡索引大小与语义完整性</td>\n<td>推荐选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不过滤</td>\n<td>保留所有语义</td>\n<td>索引膨胀，高频词的 posting list 极长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：现代搜索引擎（ES 7.x+）在使用 BM25 时，停用词对排序的影响已大幅降低（IDF 惩罚高频词），可以考虑仅在 AND 查询中过滤。</p>\n<p><strong>词干化（Stemming）</strong> 将词语还原到词根形式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"running → run&#10;studies → studi  (Porter Stemmer)&#10;better → better  (不处理形容词比较级)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>running → run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>studies → studi  (Porter Stemmer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>better → better  (不处理形容词比较级)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Porter Stemmer</strong>（英文最常用）规则示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"SSES → SS: &quot;caresses&quot; → &quot;caress&quot;&#10;IES  → I:  &quot;ponies&quot;   → &quot;poni&quot;&#10;SS   → SS: &quot;caress&quot;   → &quot;caress&quot;&#10;S    → :   &quot;cats&quot;     → &quot;cat&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>SSES → SS: \"caresses\" → \"caress\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>IES  → I:  \"ponies\"   → \"poni\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SS   → SS: \"caress\"   → \"caress\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>S    → :   \"cats\"     → \"cat\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>词形还原（Lemmatization）</strong> 比词干化更精确，利用词典还原到词典形式（lemma）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# Stemming（规则）&#10;running → run&#10;better  → better (错误：应为 good)&#10;&#10;# Lemmatization（词典）&#10;running → run&#10;better  → good   (形容词的词典形式)&#10;flies   → fly    (动词) 或 fly (名词，取决于 POS)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Stemming（规则）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>running → run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>better  → better (错误：应为 good)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Lemmatization（词典）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>running → run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>better  → good   (形容词的词典形式)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>flies   → fly    (动词) 或 fly (名词，取决于 POS)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>工程选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Porter Stemmer</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>低（过度词干化）</td>\n<td>英文通用，对精度不敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Snowball</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>多语言，Lucene 内置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lemmatization (spaCy/NLTK)</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需要精确词形还原</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中文无需词干化</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>中文形态变化少</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"同义词扩展\">同义词扩展</h2><p>同义词扩展有两种时机：<strong>索引期扩展</strong>和<strong>查询期扩展</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>索引期扩展</strong>：建索引时将同义词一并写入 posting list：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"索引期配置：&#10;  python → [python, py, 蟒蛇语言]&#10;&#10;文档&quot;使用 py 开发&quot;被索引为：&#10;  py → [doc_id]&#10;  python → [doc_id]  (扩展写入)&#10;  蟒蛇语言 → [doc_id]  (扩展写入)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>索引期配置：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  python → [python, py, 蟒蛇语言]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>文档\"使用 py 开发\"被索引为：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  py → [doc_id]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  python → [doc_id]  (扩展写入)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  蟒蛇语言 → [doc_id]  (扩展写入)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>优点：查询速度快（查询词不需要扩展）；缺点：索引体积增大。</p>\n<p><strong>查询期扩展</strong>：查询时将同义词展开为 OR 查询：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"用户查询: &quot;python&quot;&#10;查询期扩展: &quot;python&quot; OR &quot;py&quot; OR &quot;蟒蛇语言&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>用户查询: \"python\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>查询期扩展: \"python\" OR \"py\" OR \"蟒蛇语言\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>优点：索引不变，易于更新同义词词典；缺点：查询变复杂，影响查询性能。</p>\n<p><strong>Elasticsearch 同义词配置</strong>示例（查询期）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;analysis&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;filter&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;synonym_filter&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;synonym&quot;,&#10;        &quot;synonyms&quot;: [&quot;python, py, cpython&quot;, &quot;js, javascript, ecmascript&quot;, &quot;ml =&gt; machine learning, 机器学习&quot;]&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"analysis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"filter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"synonym_filter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"synonym\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"synonyms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"python, py, cpython\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"js, javascript, ecmascript\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ml => machine learning, 机器学习\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>=&gt;</code> 表示单向扩展（搜索 &quot;ml&quot; 时查找 &quot;machine learning&quot;，但搜索 &quot;machine learning&quot; 不查找 &quot;ml&quot;）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"n-gram-与字符-n-gram\">N-gram 与字符 N-gram</h2><p><strong>词级 N-gram</strong> 捕获词序信息，用于短语查询和语义消歧：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"文本: &quot;deep learning frameworks&quot;&#10;&#10;unigram (n=1): [deep, learning, frameworks]&#10;bigram  (n=2): [deep learning, learning frameworks]&#10;trigram (n=3): [deep learning frameworks]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>文本: \"deep learning frameworks\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unigram (n=1): [deep, learning, frameworks]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>bigram  (n=2): [deep learning, learning frameworks]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>trigram (n=3): [deep learning frameworks]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>字符 N-gram</strong> 对拼写错误有天然容错能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"词: &quot;python&quot;&#10;&#10;bigram:  [py, yt, th, ho, on]&#10;trigram: [pyt, yth, tho, hon]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>词: \"python\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>bigram:  [py, yt, th, ho, on]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>trigram: [pyt, yth, tho, hon]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>字符 trigram 用途：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>拼写纠错</strong>：查询词 &quot;pytohn&quot; 与 &quot;python&quot; 共享 3/5 个 trigram</li>\n<li><strong>模糊查询</strong>：edit distance 近似计算</li>\n<li><strong>短词匹配</strong>：中文单字分词后的扩充</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>N-gram 类型</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>推荐场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Unigram</td>\n<td>最简单，索引最小</td>\n<td>无法处理词序</td>\n<td>大多数场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Word Bigram</td>\n<td>短语语义</td>\n<td>索引增大 2-3 倍</td>\n<td>短语敏感查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Char Trigram</td>\n<td>拼写容错</td>\n<td>索引大，召回噪声多</td>\n<td>模糊匹配、自动补全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Edge N-gram</td>\n<td>前缀匹配</td>\n<td>只能做前缀</td>\n<td>搜索框自动补全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>预处理管道必须<strong>文档期和查询期保持一致</strong>，否则会出现词项不匹配导致的假缺失（false absence）</li>\n<li><strong>中文分词</strong>是中文 IR 系统最关键的预处理步骤；搜索引擎模式（Jieba）或字符 bigram 是两种互补策略</li>\n<li><strong>停用词过滤</strong>在 BM25 体系下价值下降，但对 AND 查询性能优化仍有意义</li>\n<li><strong>词干化 vs 词形还原</strong>：工程场景优先 Snowball（速度+精度平衡），精度敏感场景用 spaCy lemmatizer</li>\n<li><strong>同义词扩展</strong>推荐查询期扩展，保持索引灵活可更新</li>\n<li><strong>字符 N-gram</strong>是自动补全（edge n-gram）和模糊查询（trigram）的标准技术</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>章内延伸</strong>：本篇处理的词项直接进入倒排索引（本章第 2 篇）；词项质量影响 BM25（第 2 章第 1 篇）的 tf 统计准确性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"文本预处理管道","id":"文本预处理管道"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分词：中文与多语言挑战","id":"分词-中文与多语言挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"停用词过滤与词干化","id":"停用词过滤与词干化"},{"level":2,"text":"同义词扩展","id":"同义词扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"N-gram 与字符 N-gram","id":"n-gram-与字符-n-gram"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"倒排索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/foundations/inverted-index"},"next":{"title":"BM25 与 TF-IDF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/ranking/bm25-tfidf"}}